  Pin: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>. Author: parent
  <verbatim|hairer-codex-existence-20261111>. Output:
  <verbatim|manuscript/existence/actual-local-compiler-handoff.tex>.
  Independent review pending. This is the bounded C1\UC8 application proposed
  in <verbatim|reviews/closure-audit.md>; upstream actual history hypotheses
  are retained.

  <section|Exact input and conclusion><label|exact-input-and-conclusion>

  Fix one gauge G, Teller P, patch D, chart J with LocalRatio and the branch
  choices of P.bind, Purse i; e=Docking.increment(load i.era+1)\<gtr\>=0. Fix
  positive footprint t, owner m, K, W, epsilon, nonnegative d; 2K\<less\>=m/2
  and 2*i.era.coast.a\<less\>=K/4. Input actual Footprint.reserve at this e;
  eventual Granite and Peaking on that same tuple. Their analytic content is
  supplied by canonical seed guides, chart/branches, actual row/palette and
  owner proofs, while actual Alongside and inherited-law/path/clip/Tissue
  identifications remain explicit.

  Produce the local matrix/word/palette ingredients on one retimed interval,
  then genuine-source BodyGrant and white-source Veins on one corrected
  alphabet, then the actual short step and both weakened Kiln estimates. This
  is not an unconditional construction of the original funded history.

  <section|Inspected source (all under Lean/YM at the
  pin)><label|inspected-source-all-under-leanym-at-the-pin>

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item><verbatim|AnalyticBridge/RELATIVE_LOGDET_TRACE/Year.lean>:
    namespace <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.RelativeLogdet>; <verbatim|worth>,
    <verbatim|currency_eventual>, <verbatim|Physical.Certified>,
    <verbatim|Physical.parcel>, <verbatim|Physical.late_price>. Common post-L
    v,C,eta,b,kappa, all actual masks/forests/tags/coarse V; actual
    AFull/fog, all Bars(B/60) recuts; both inventories n=0,1 with l=20.
    Literal rate choices Y/2, v=Y/4, R=(Y/2-v)/120, b=R/2, kappa=b/2,
    theta=b/[4(l+2)] and exponent b-theta(n+1+l)\<gtr\>=3b/4.

    <item><verbatim|PhysicalNext/PHYSICAL_JOINT_ENDPOINT_LOAD_F16/DLog/Fund.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.EndpointLoadF16.DetLong.stores>,
    <verbatim|Fund.Stock>, <verbatim|Fund.Stock.recite>,
    <verbatim|Fund.Recital.maestro>. stores arguments n,k,l=(2,1,20), record
    order l,n,k=(20,2,1). deck, buys and cover all retained. width is
    min(radius(G,1)/2,r), not replacement profile width. total conversion fee
    4*letterFee(G,2,1)*exp(1)*myCost(1), myCost(1)=4.

    <item><verbatim|AnalyticBridge/SECTOR_COVARIANCE_JETS/{Quote,RowStack,Packets,Deposit,Sky,Roof}.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.Covariance.entries>, <verbatim|stack>,
    <verbatim|ascension>, <verbatim|fluctuate>, <verbatim|nearby_gap>,
    <verbatim|trusting>, <verbatim|fromTeller>, <verbatim|coverall>,
    <verbatim|Deck>. Crucial correction to a mere compactness argument:
    fixed-radius trust uses weighted row/slot derivative sums first, then
    Schur fluctuation and a uniform gap shrink. The prose includes that
    argument, half-radius germ identification, and fixed flags even on
    perturbed fields outside the original licensed set. Canonical reuse:
    predictor-branch, row-quadratic-price path holomorphy and absolute slot
    sums, sector-gram, local-covariance, normalization-jets,
    itinerary-prices. Review should check that the slot/derivative-coordinate
    price specialization is sufficiently explicit at order2 to buy order1.

    <item><verbatim|PhysicalNext/AFTERNOON_INTERACTING_RANK_COMPARISON/Opacity/Offers.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.InteractingRank.Pump.Seeks>, <verbatim|hoops>.
    Neutral(v) is used for these hypotheses; source path/clip, bp.threshold,
    original period, Larger, Alongside, Lawful, support exponent, walls, beta
    band and fine threshold are all actual inputs. <verbatim|Milk.launched>
    uses owner energy and exact path counts.

    <item><verbatim|.../Soft/French.lean>:
    <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.InteractingRank.Soft.Kraft>,
    <verbatim|accepts_stock>. Same Year/Stock/Granite/Pupil/noises constants;
    finite conjunction pulled by retime then uniform x in [s/2,s]; Tissue
    correction via affixed, weathered; BodyGrant genuine(v.source), Veins
    white(v.source), same z=shiftZ(sprouting H M), H/M chosen before output
    Q. Positive reference loading from LocalRatio, beta, and kinetic
    determinant.

    <item><verbatim|.../Soft/Bonfire.lean>: <verbatim|Soft.lifted>,
    <verbatim|fury>: actual plateau Teller equals initials, fitPost gives
    neutral Seeks, n=k-(i+1), original Tissue supplied separately; set coarse
    beta=input beta, scalar loading then pyro_gen, exact masked
    remainder/path/clip. Empty-marker Resin uses that same alphabet.

    <item><verbatim|.../Soft/Unlid.lean>: <verbatim|Soft.stove>,
    <verbatim|arousing>: explicit two price weakenings of same
    Veins/Resin/Lease/BodyGrant; finite marked ReturnTrip and Reparations;
    made_soft exact push. Canonical source-normalized marked compiler and
    restarted-rank-history retain the original denominator.
  </itemize-minus>

  For Star/Fares native callback details reuse already-reviewed
  actual-rank-purchases and public-run-binding; no separate reread or new
  native witness selection is claimed in this change.

  <section|Status and checks><label|status-and-checks>

  Shared literature notes were checked earlier for these canonical local
  results; no external theorem substitution is made. Exact elementary finite
  sums, gap perturbation and exponential payments are proved or reuse the
  stated chapters. <verbatim|git diff --check>: passed. No fresh Lean
  build/axiom replay. LaTeX/render and independent source/mathematical checks
  pending. The prior inherited audit limits continue to apply. Material edits
  require renewed review; unit remains draft.

